<body>
    <h1>=F0=9F=8E=B2 Jackaroo User Personas</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"e089e369d751" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPers=
onas-WhyWeBuiltThisPersona">Why We Built This Persona</h1>
<p local-id=3D"909da77cfa26">Jackaroo and Baloot are both beloved card and =
board games in the Arab world, but they attract meaningfully different play=
er profiles. Before we launch Jackaroo as a new game mode inside VIP Baloot=
, we need to understand who we are really building and marketing this featu=
re for =E2=80=94 because defaulting to our existing Baloot audience could l=
ead to misaligned messaging, wasted ad spend, and a missed opportunity to g=
row our TAM.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e3ce96e770f5"></p>
<p local-id=3D"befd28e76510">This document captures the primary persona for=
 the Jackaroo player, grounded in behavioral research, regional gaming tren=
ds, and first-party signals from similar casual-strategy games in the MENA =
market. It is intended as a shared reference for the Marketing team to alig=
n acquisition channels, creative direction, and in-app communication.</p>
<p local-id=3D"618ee9c68ae5">&nbsp;</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"9ca5c313778a" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-The=
PersonaataGlance">The Persona at a Glance</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4d=
4d1b82-36d5-494b-b890-7fbdf37729ec" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"24e7ef87-a53c-47e2-abea-fd34dfaa0a49">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"61a3c34d-6654-46b4-9=
503-680212526796" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b611abdb726"><strong>Name</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"c923d878-11cd-4e86-a=
7e6-61522ab8b637" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82bfb031d9c3">Khalid =E2=80=94 "The Family Game Night King</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d38b2a5509a2">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"7b1af8ba-22b6-4457-8=
3ae-4c886a3a8f65" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32bd245f2dad"><strong>Age</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"a4e564774fef" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a4cbc0fc0b74">24 =E2=80=93 38 years old</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ba7114bd0a10">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"c7801acc-3fb0-4adb-9=
61a-3bceb6f842bb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"341bdfdbfcdf"><strong>Gender</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"5fd7e8ad-1e2f-4a73-a=
f5c-c5d8fed6547a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3c2b55a154f6">Primarily male (65%), meaningful female segmen=
t (35%) =E2=80=94 especially in family settings</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4eb37acd18b2">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"c17659e0-1570-4ef2-9=
72e-0a070d38bcbd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2396da55fabd"><strong>Geography</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"f3025999-9922-42d9-b=
7dc-ad0ef730a26b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d499022d457">Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, UAE, Jordan, Egypt (dias=
pora)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5aa7d6047ae4">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"5da8f351-a93d-4bf9-a=
a4f-faae73c6573f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3bb3e9118af"><strong>Device</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"ccf53d8e-947a-4fbc-a=
da3-c1c68a5aed4a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8cef3af21442">Android-first (70%), iOS secondary (30%). Mid-=
range to flagship smartphones.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e127fe861be6">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"baa23c4f-5c95-4c13-8=
661-141e7ba232e3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d808d7f9554"><strong>Session Length</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"0ed97937-1a89-48e1-b=
743-bc390a1d5867" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b42f3ad74a8d">25=E2=80=9345 minutes per session (longer than=
 Baloot's typical 15=E2=80=9320 min)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d64d290fdb5">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"6482f59e-7cd9-4570-b=
0ca-091e5d46f4c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96e53ce6502c"><strong>Play Context</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"7c62f3b304c0" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"581ace987dce">Family gatherings, evenings at home, social ha=
ngouts =E2=80=94 not commutes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"48df01955bae">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"1e9f5002-028c-481c-b=
bb2-49c5ddb6743f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6238ba5e4cd2"><strong>Monetization</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"e3ed3e59-6b00-4c18-a=
bd6-84d6a127b315" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e006f4a2fe64">Mid-tier spender. Willing to pay for cosmetics=
, boards, and tokens =E2=80=94 not P2W mechanics</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h1 local-id=3D"b75417ba3af0" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Dee=
pProfile:WhoIsKhalid?">Deep Profile: Who Is Khalid?</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"b2cbc2c286e6" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Bac=
kground&amp;LifeStage">Background &amp; Life Stage</h2>
<p local-id=3D"b80cedad0ebd">Khalid is in his late 20s or early 30s. He has=
 a full-time job =E2=80=94 probably in a corporate, government, or trades r=
ole =E2=80=94 and his social life revolves around family and a tight circle=
 of friends. He grew up playing Jackaroo on a physical board at his grandmo=
ther's house, and the game carries genuine nostalgia and emotional weight f=
or him.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9127fff723ed">He is digitally fluent and spends meaningful t=
ime on social platforms (TikTok, Instagram, Snapchat), but he is not a "har=
dcore gamer." He does not follow esports, does not own a console primarily =
for competitive gaming, and his mobile game usage is driven by social and e=
motional motivation =E2=80=94 not skill progression.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b23f87c9e50a">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"ab21aeb3c226" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Gam=
ingBehavior">Gaming Behavior</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"03=
3e4b1b-fdae-4816-aeb8-8d1a1deda6c6" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"688cb0ce-0569-4257-8073-70135f3ed03f">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"e2b9e87e-0814-4d40-a=
008-ec0e53674c6b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6df4573efc45"><strong>Gaming frequency</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"181409d2-bfaa-4e64-87e8-74c433032240" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a9844229f69">3=E2=80=935 sessions per week</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"896d6fa8-80a0-48e8-b642-874ee4d17ef0">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"f6e5eefa-4d93-43fd-8=
301-acf7486be064" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38e51e35501e"><strong>Preferred time</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"71ea0a61-d5c5-4002-8056-e19015855432" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aae9b6d58045">Evening (after 9 PM), weekends</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"36f99f21-272c-465b-be23-84c6332aa6aa">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"b1c8c30c-1ab3-4e5d-9=
ca9-643dee8ca12f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67bfad94e942"><strong>Game genres</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"53c742ed-53a4-44dc-807d-700df0f0f6d7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a236695c3d6b">Board games, card games, casual strategy, part=
y games</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9bbdb4e4-fc40-4ada-803d-0ee73582bde0">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"eea63fd0-eb14-4b32-b=
413-51edc53518b2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"206532d9b0f7"><strong>Also plays</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f0140de0-8115-4406-8e3c-1b5d73d1dad2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"97662333dc3d">Ludo Star, Garena Speed Drifters, Word games</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6cea6b4d-3222-4300-8942-826a6573f4e3">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"b96103f0-6ba2-4dea-a=
0b1-cd136871b208" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04eb72cc1ec9"><strong>Pain point</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9401ad8e-b9bc-476c-9227-f44bb522c837" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fabc9d3a3c45">Wants to play with specific friends/family, no=
t random strangers</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1005b22c-c116-4466-aa62-0f70a649a818">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"49f8777d-9584-4354-8=
535-3ceec1e2c33a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"63d9000fcee7"><strong>Churn trigger</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8a82262-81e4-4f77-90ff-9252b29b72c4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"827b16ca8b9c">Long wait times, toxic random players, pay-to-=
win mechanics</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"4514c7a0a2a7">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"53d350f8ce9f" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Mot=
ivationsforPlayingJackaroo(vs.Baloot)">Motivations for Playing Jackaroo (vs=
. Baloot)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6e92c981702d">Understanding the motivational difference is c=
ritical for messaging. Jackaroo is not a substitute for Baloot =E2=80=94 it=
 fills a different psychological role:</p>
<p local-id=3D"057a22e0e8af">&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2c=
a5b404-7490-43db-8b01-eedbe3a44d10" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"410110a0-eaee-48b0-a41d-f4395eeed720">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"1f773574-eeee-468b-8=
5de-00e91ab03b48" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"21c8369e946a"><strong>Social bonding</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dcba40b-2a07-4061-84bc-9d32a3b9b3de" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3e15da587aa">Jackaroo is a 4-player cooperative-competitive=
 game. Khalid wants to play WITH his cousin or wife, not against a stranger=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"315595bf-51fe-4686-9a30-e118b9c75d5e">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"41323f0d-f15b-4bcb-b=
fdf-5375ec238bc4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"459056fe0937"><strong>Nostalgia &amp; identity</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d5088d9-46ad-4535-a609-83b5eee25eb3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4352ce5ad1a8">The physical board version is a cultural artif=
act. A digital Jackaroo signals cultural pride =E2=80=94 "a game that is ou=
rs."</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"180755fc-9c88-40a6-a2cd-075dcca41c4d">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"39586892-f75c-4259-b=
0b5-80925fb68067" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b5ddde42537b"><strong>Casual competition</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e7ddc72-dfc5-4397-b3e7-e7ad58731383" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"83171f076fdf">Khalid wants to win, but stakes are social (br=
agging rights), not financial.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7cc2d634-6db6-4f4a-9790-0d0f5da0b445">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"8d28c3a3-c3eb-485f-9=
c00-5bb404690ad9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52a4eb487fc1"><strong>Low cognitive overhead</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb6efee1-f834-4e77-aa5b-2048204a4f43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5485fc6b0086">Jackaroo is simpler to learn than Baloot. Khal=
id can onboard a new family member mid-session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5733033d-1a18-4300-82c6-25c17a153823">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ede7f6" data-local-id=3D"488dd06d-a986-4805-8=
9cd-ec117d035656" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"591a75bef3a8"><strong>Entertainment for groups</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-local-id=3D"808c7ea3-6cf9-4ae2-ae9b-8c326bce7b4d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"662af5db2547">Khalid is often the one who "hosts" the game o=
n his phone for a group watching on one screen.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"3021441f8ecd">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"5b8f1ec2f9ae" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Psy=
chographicProfile">Psychographic Profile</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f053714fcfb2">&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b9=
87a6ef-8ba7-4ba7-adda-f88af2679895" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8801b6c1-ac2d-40d8-893b-2eeda31072e3">
