<h2 local-id=3D"a5b7a0d88aa5" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Cre=
ativeDirection">Creative Direction</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"807c4e5c913d">
<li local-id=3D"1294ab5ce1d8">
<p local-id=3D"46683f8e9084">Lead with family and friendship moments, not s=
olo player wins.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"5e6f5ce6d9a6">
<li local-id=3D"8ac9b8982a35">
<p local-id=3D"531e6c161213">Show the board clearly =E2=80=94 trigger visua=
l nostalgia from the physical game.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"105f97ab0b46">
<li local-id=3D"5bc202861f19">
<p local-id=3D"3841575b8fbf">Use Gulf Arabic dialect in copy (not MSA) =E2=
=80=94 especially for Saudi/Kuwaiti primary market.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"f70f726abf15">
<li local-id=3D"b83e072edbfb">
<p local-id=3D"f8b235f37661">Avoid hardcore gamer aesthetic. Warmth, humor,=
 and familiarity beat hype.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"b97f1d2c135e">
<li local-id=3D"4789a65c2e8b">
<p local-id=3D"9c49e157a1b0">Highlight "play with friends easily" as a key =
UX differentiator.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d796d5fc24f9">&nbsp;</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"fef780f06ef5" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-In-=
AppMessagingPriorities">In-App Messaging Priorities</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"d571ba69add9">
<li local-id=3D"150b2229c470">
<p local-id=3D"023b4dff2155">Onboarding: Emphasize private room creation an=
d friend invites =E2=80=94 not random matchmaking first.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"580b2391e096">
<li local-id=3D"aa0e6e1bb830">
<p local-id=3D"78d801aea128">Monetization: Lead with board skins, marble se=
ts, themed tables (cultural/seasonal). Avoid energy mechanics.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"790d50837baf">
<li local-id=3D"feb92233ea9b">
<p local-id=3D"11d4891382c3">Retention: Weekly "Family Challenge" events. S=
easonal themes (Ramadan, Eid, National Day).</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"9a642582357e">
<li local-id=3D"d126c78d8f45">
<p local-id=3D"8d76c0ab07f0">Notification copy: Social triggers ("Your cous=
in Faisal is waiting in the room") outperform generic prompts.</p></li>
</ul>
