<h1 local-id=3D"00b62189f812" id=3D"id-=F0=9F=8E=B2JackarooUserPersonas-Job=
stoBeDone(JTBD)">Jobs to Be Done (JTBD)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"b83d326e323e">When I am spending an evening with family or f=
riends and we want to play something together on one phone or our own phone=
s, I want to play Jackaroo digitally so I can recreate the fun of our old b=
oard game without needing the physical set, waiting for a full table, or de=
aling with strangers.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4f321b58212e">&nbsp;</p>
